{"3048980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rat Raze / Road to Riches - Tilt Five", "steam_appid": 3048980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "* Tilt Five AR system required *<br><br>Discover 2 brand new digital SmartGames demo’s for the amazing Tilt Five AR system! These demo games are for 2 players, there is one head-to-head and one co-op game for you to enjoy. If you like these demo’s, show us your support and we will turn them into full games!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Rat Raze</h2>In this crazy sliding race game 2 players compete to cross the finish line first. Each player slides the puzzle pieces in the right sequence, the arrows dictate the direction the car will go.<br><br>Use your Tilt Five wand's joystick to slide the pieces on the gameboard.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/be97daa42d912084af9449da77e35850.poster.avif?t=1721033286\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/be97daa42d912084af9449da77e35850.webm?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/be97daa42d912084af9449da77e35850.mp4?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Then pull the joystick’s trigger to start your car and race to the finish.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/25dda655cbc3705ac81b77a86dd7ae1c.poster.avif?t=1721033286\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/25dda655cbc3705ac81b77a86dd7ae1c.webm?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/25dda655cbc3705ac81b77a86dd7ae1c.mp4?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game is all about speed. Be fast and race your car over the finish line first to win!<br>This free demo version of Rat Raze comes with 8 different courses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Road to Riches</h2>In this co-op game 2 players work together to build islands and roads so the pirate can find all the treasures.<br>Players take turns to place a piece and build a path. Not all treasures are visible to both players! <br>Communication between players is key as you try to find &amp; build roads between all treasure chests.<br> <br>Guide the pirate to every treasure chest you can find!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/19bb86a428308f7e598ae240ade22c89.poster.avif?t=1721033286\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/19bb86a428308f7e598ae240ade22c89.webm?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/19bb86a428308f7e598ae240ade22c89.mp4?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cooperate with your partner to find the location of every chest.<br> <br>To place a road, point your Tilt Five wand and pull the trigger. The pirate is smart and will automatically walk when roads are built. No time to waste to get these chests!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/4e7f86c9f8e6a4505e0753268dc66cd1.poster.avif?t=1721033286\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/4e7f86c9f8e6a4505e0753268dc66cd1.webm?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/4e7f86c9f8e6a4505e0753268dc66cd1.mp4?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>But beware, you have a limited number of pieces!<br> <br>Players must also avoid disturbing the kraken, it will steal every tile placed on top of it.<br>This demo version of Road to Riches comes with 6 levels.<br><br>If you like our games, show us your support!", "about_the_game": "* Tilt Five AR system required *<br><br>Discover 2 brand new digital SmartGames demo’s for the amazing Tilt Five AR system! These demo games are for 2 players, there is one head-to-head and one co-op game for you to enjoy. If you like these demo’s, show us your support and we will turn them into full games!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Rat Raze</h2>In this crazy sliding race game 2 players compete to cross the finish line first. Each player slides the puzzle pieces in the right sequence, the arrows dictate the direction the car will go.<br><br>Use your Tilt Five wand's joystick to slide the pieces on the gameboard.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/be97daa42d912084af9449da77e35850.poster.avif?t=1721033286\" width=324 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/be97daa42d912084af9449da77e35850.webm?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/extras/be97daa42d912084af9449da77e35850.mp4?t=1721033286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Then pull the joystick’s trigger to start your car and race to the finish.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048980/ex